error[type-mismatch] 3:10-3:20
  (sort-by (fn [x] x) [(decimal.from-int 2) (decimal.from-int 1)])
           ^^^^^^^^^^
  sort-by needs a key that is an Int, Float, String, Bool, or a tuple of them.
  Expected: a sort key
  Found: decimal.Decimal
  decimal.Decimal is not a sort key, because its text does not order like its value. Compare two with decimal.compare.
  Help: sx help sort-by
